| $x$ | $e$ | $c$ | $a$ | $d$ | $b$ | $h$ | $g$ | $f$ |
|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|
| $\varphi(x)$ | $1$ | $-1$ | $1$ | $-1$ | $1$ | $-1$ | $1$ | $-1$ |

**验证同态性质**：对任意 $x = c^i, y = c^j$，有 $xy = c^{i+j}$，故

$$\varphi(xy) = \varphi(c^{i+j}) = (-1)^{i+j} = (-1)^i \cdot (-1)^j = \varphi(x)\,\varphi(y) \quad \checkmark$$

用 Python 对全部 64 对 $(x,y)$ 逐一验证，均满足 $\varphi(xy) = \varphi(x)\varphi(y)$。

